data modify storage arnis:npc chat set value ["The buses are never on time around here.","I heard they're opening a new bakery soon.","Did you see the sunset yesterday? Unreal.","My cat knocked my coffee over this morning.","This street was all fields when my grandma was young.","I keep meaning to visit the museum.","Someone's been leaving flowers on the benches. Nice, right?","I'm learning to juggle. Badly.","There's a shortcut through the park, if you know where to look.","I swear the pigeons here are getting bigger.","Rain later, apparently. Bring a brolly.","I just finished the best book. No spoilers.","My neighbour plays trumpet at 7am. Every day.","Have you tried the cafe on the corner? So good.","I lost my keys twice this week.","Traffic's been wild today.","I'm thinking of getting a dog.","They say the old tower is haunted. I don't buy it.","I could walk these streets all day.","You look like you're on a mission.","I tried to bake bread. It became a brick.","There's a squirrel here that steals sandwiches. Watch out.","I'm saving up for a bike. A really nice one.","My plants are thriving. My social life, less so.","Someone drew a smiley face on the crosswalk. Made my day.","I always get lost in the station. Every time.","The ice cream truck plays the same song for hours.","I met my best friend on this street, ten years ago.","Do you ever wonder who lived in these buildings first?","I'm taking a pottery class. My bowls are all wonky.","The library has a cat now. Official staff member.","I haven't checked my phone all day. Feels great.","Somebody's been practising violin by an open window. It's getting better.","Have you seen the stars from the hill? Worth the climb.","My grandad still waves at every train that passes.","I keep a list of every dog I've petted. Forty-two so far.","I swear this town looks different every morning.","Big plans this weekend: absolutely nothing.","The corner shop knows my order by heart. Is that bad?","If you see a lost glove on a fence, that's mine."]
data modify storage arnis:npc sorry set value ["Sorry, I'm not from around here.","Oh, no idea, sorry! Maybe ask someone else?","Hmm, I couldn't tell you. Sorry!","Sorry, I'm terrible with directions.","Couldn't say, I only moved here last week.","Ah, I always get that one mixed up. Sorry!","My phone's dead, so I'm as lost as you.","No clue, honestly. I just follow the pigeons.","Sorry, I'd only get you more lost.","I know it's around here somewhere... sorry, no idea."]
